WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.067 --> 00:00:04.003
- We have to understand what
we're good and bad at and you

00:00:04.003 --> 00:00:06.106
have to let go of
what you're bad at.

00:00:06.106 --> 00:00:07.197
You have to.

00:00:07.197 --> 00:00:10.911
If you're naturally bad at
singing like I am you shouldn't

00:00:10.911 --> 00:00:14.581
put your career and your
life in a position to become a

00:00:14.581 --> 00:00:15.582
professional singer.

00:00:15.582 --> 00:00:18.619
It's a bad idea and I think
a lot of people want to be

00:00:18.619 --> 00:00:20.721
entrepreneurs and business
people 'cause it sounds

00:00:20.721 --> 00:00:22.623
glamorous to make 
$1 million a year on

00:00:22.623 --> 00:00:25.092
your terms on your own schedule.

00:00:25.092 --> 00:00:27.594
The problem is it's a talent.

00:00:27.594 --> 00:00:31.331
It is a talent to be a business
person and you can become the

00:00:31.331 --> 00:00:36.169
best version of yourself, right,
but it's like being pretty.

00:00:36.169 --> 00:00:38.638
Like you can become prettier.

00:00:38.638 --> 00:00:41.008
You can get tans,
you can work out,

00:00:41.008 --> 00:00:43.944
you know, but mom and dad had
sex at the right moment and your

00:00:43.944 --> 00:00:44.878
nose is your nose.

00:00:44.878 --> 00:00:46.747
Now, you can have
plastic surgery.

00:00:46.747 --> 00:00:50.250
There is no plastic surgery in
business so I need people to

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:51.885
wrap their head around that.

00:00:51.885 --> 00:00:56.223
I don't know how to help people
do more of it other than scream

00:00:56.223 --> 00:00:59.293
at the top of my lungs about
it for the rest of my life but

00:00:59.293 --> 00:01:02.829
anything that can help you get
into a place where you can not

00:01:02.829 --> 00:01:07.267
dwell, not complain, not
allow the negativity to seep in,

00:01:07.267 --> 00:01:09.636
it will bring you
enormous dividends.

00:01:09.636 --> 00:01:14.366
Whether that's a life coach 
or a therapist or

00:01:14.366 --> 00:01:17.436
a two month retreat to reset or

00:01:17.436 --> 00:01:20.047
I don't know
but whatever it is please,

00:01:20.047 --> 00:01:22.282
please, please realize
how big of a deal it is.

